      <section id="payment"><h2>Payment</h2><p>By card on the site or against an invoice. After payment we email a receipt to the address you give.</p></section>
      <section id="delivery"><h2>How we provide the service or deliver</h2><p>We state the time and the way when you order: a service is provided at the agreed time, and goods are handed over or shipped within five business days.</p></section>
      <section id="return"><h2>Cancellations and returns</h2>
        <p id="return-goods">Goods: you may cancel before delivery and return goods within 14 days of receiving them; we refund within 14 days of getting them back. Faulty goods are covered by your statutory rights as well.</p>
