      <section id="claims"><h2>Complaints</h2><p>Write to {{email}}: we answer in writing within 10 days and tell you what we are doing.</p></section>
      <section id="offer"><h2>The offer</h2><p>The full text: <a href="#offer-text">the terms of sale</a>. A contract is formed when you do “{{mainAction.label}}” and pay for the order.</p></section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
`
